namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamProgressBar {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar
    src   "A progress bar whose hierarchy is code, not an asset.\n\nTwo nodes and no behaviour: a track that IS the root -- the button's face-is-root argument, a bar\nis one rectangle -- and a fill inside it that the control drives. UUIProgressBar exists and could\ndrive the same geometry, but a behaviour earns its place by owning interaction or per-frame work\n(marquee), and a plain bar has neither; the control writing the fill itself is smaller than\nhanding a part to a component whose other features it hides.\n\nTWO SHAPES, ONE CONTROL. Bar spends the percent as the fill's WIDTH; Radial spends it as a swept\nANGLE and the two rects become rings. That is one enum rather than two classes for the reason the\nslider has one Direction rather than two Blueprint presets: the parts, the property and the style\nare identical and only the drawing differs. Radial rides the fill rect's OWN RadialFill wedge --\nno second visual, no mask, no material variant -- and the ring itself is the rect's border with\nits body switched off, because a border is the only hole this primitive has.\n\nA Throbber falls out of that and needs no class of its own: a Radial bar at a fixed Percent whose\nRadialStartAngle (or the widget's rotation) an animation spins is exactly the spinner UMG ships,\nand it is styled from the same sheet as every other bar in the project.\n\nUMG parity is UProgressBar's core: Percent in 0..1, SetPercent/GetPercent, no events -- progress\nis written by code, so there is nobody to notify.\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamProgressBar LoadProgress {\n        Percent = 0.35\n    }\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamProgressBar Spinner {\n        Shape = Radial\n        Percent = 0.25\n    }"
    text  "一个层级结构由代码而非资产定义的进度条。\n\n两个节点，没有行为：一条本身就是根节点的轨道——这与按钮的face-is-root论点相同，\n一个条就是一个矩形——以及其中一块由控件驱动的填充。UUIProgressBar存在，也能驱动\n同样的几何体，但一个行为之所以有其位置，是因为它承担了交互或逐帧工作（跑马灯），\n而普通的条两者皆无；由控件自己写入填充，比把某个部件交给一个会顺带隐藏\n其他功能的组件要轻量。\n\n两种形状，一个控件。Bar把百分比用作填充的宽度；Radial把它用作扫过\n的角度，两个矩形于是变成圆环。它是一个枚举而不是两个类，理由和滑块\n只有一个Direction而不是两个蓝图预设一样：部件、属性和样式\n完全相同，只有绘制方式不同。Radial借助填充矩形自身的RadialFill楔形——\n没有第二个可视对象、没有遮罩、没有材质变体——而圆环本身就是关闭了\n主体的矩形边框，因为边框是这个图元唯一拥有的中空部分。\n\nThrobber由此自然得出，不需要自己的类：一个固定Percent的Radial条，其\nRadialStartAngle（或控件的旋转）由动画旋转，正是UMG自带的旋转指示器，\n而且它与项目中其他每个条都从同一张样式表取样式。\n\n与UMG对齐是UProgressBar的核心：Percent在0..1，SetPercent/GetPercent，没有事件——进度\n由代码写入，因此无人需要通知。\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamProgressBar LoadProgress {\n        Percent = 0.35\n    }\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamProgressBar Spinner {\n        Shape = Radial\n        Percent = 0.25\n    }"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:bIsMarquee {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:bIsMarquee
    src   "The INDETERMINATE bar -- UMG's bIsMarquee: a short fill sweeping the track forever, for work\nwhose length nobody knows.\n\nPercent is ignored while this is on, which is the whole meaning of indeterminate; the fill's\nown length becomes MarqueeFraction of the track. It is the one thing on this control that costs\na per-frame tick, so the tick is opted in and out with the flag rather than left running: a\ndeterminate bar pays nothing.\n\nBar only. The class comment offers the ring's own answer for a spinner -- a Radial at a fixed\nPercent whose rotation an animation drives -- and that one needs no tick from this control."
    text  "不确定态条——UMG的bIsMarquee：一小段填充在轨道上永远扫过，用于\n长度无人知晓的工作。\n\n开启此项时忽略Percent，这正是“不确定”的全部含义；填充自身的\n长度成为轨道的MarqueeFraction。它是此控件上唯一需要\n逐帧tick的东西，因此tick由该标志按需开启和关闭，而不是一直运行：\n确定态的条不付出任何代价。\n\n仅限Bar。类注释给出了圆环自身的加载指示器方案——一个固定\nPercent的Radial，其旋转由动画驱动——那个方案不需要此控件提供tick。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:FillColorAndOpacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:FillColorAndOpacity
    src   "A tint over the style's fill colour -- UMG's FillColorAndOpacity, which is a tint over\nSProgressBar's fill image for the same reason: the style says what a filled bar looks like,\nand this says what is happening to this one right now. White is no opinion."
    text  "叠加在样式填充颜色之上的着色——即UMG的FillColorAndOpacity（填充颜色与不透明度），它出于同样的理由\n叠加在SProgressBar的填充图像之上：样式说明填充好的条长什么样，\n而这个属性说明此刻这一个条正在发生什么。白色表示不表态。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:FillType {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:FillType
    src   "Which edge the fill grows from. Bar only -- a ring's direction is its RadialStartAngle, which\nthe style already states."
    text  "填充从哪条边生长出来。仅限Bar——圆环的方向由其RadialStartAngle决定，\n样式已经说明了这一点。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:MarqueeDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:MarqueeDuration
    src   "Seconds for one sweep, entrance to exit. Zero or less parks the sweep at the start edge."
    text  "一次扫过（从进入到退出）所需的秒数。为零或更小时，扫过停在起始边缘。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:MarqueeFraction {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:MarqueeFraction
    src   "How much of the track the sweeping fill covers, 0..1. A fraction rather than a pixel count for\nthe reason every other length on this control is one: a bar is stretched by whoever placed it."
    text  "扫过的填充覆盖轨道的多少，0..1。用比例而不是像素值，理由与此控件上\n其他每个长度相同：条由放置它的人拉伸。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:MarqueeTime {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:MarqueeTime
    src   "How far the marquee has swept, in seconds, wrapped into one cycle. Transient because a sweep is\na live gesture and not something a package should remember."
    text  "跑马灯已扫过的距离，以秒计，回绕在一个周期内。之所以是瞬态，是因为扫过是\n一个实时动作，而不是包应当记住的东西。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:Percent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:Percent
    src   "How much of the track is filled, 0..1. A property so .dui and bindings can see it; the value\nis stored as authored and clamped only where it becomes geometry, which is UMG's arrangement.\n\nBlueprintSetter, not a bare writable field: nothing re-derives a control from a property that\nchanged, so a runtime `Set Percent` straight onto the variable used to move the number and\nleave the fill where it was -- visible to nobody until something else happened to restyle."
    text  "轨道被填充的比例，0..1。它是一个属性，因此.dui和绑定都能看到它；数值\n按编写时的样子存储，只在成为几何体时才被钳制，这正是UMG的做法。\n\n是BlueprintSetter（蓝图Setter），而不是裸露的可写字段：属性变化不会让任何东西\n重新推导控件，因此运行时直接对变量执行`Set Percent`，过去只会移动\n数字而把填充留在原处——除非有别的事情重新设定了样式，否则谁也看不出来。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:SetFillType {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:SetFillType
    src   "Re-places the fill: the direction decides which edge it is anchored to and which axis it spends."
    text  "重新放置填充：方向决定它锚定在哪条边，以及它消耗哪条轴。"
    state machine
}

