DreamProgressBar:SetMarqueeFraction {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:SetMarqueeFraction
    src   "How wide the sweeping fill is. Clamped where the property is, and re-placed at once: the\nwidth is read by the sweep, and a sweep parked by a zero duration would otherwise keep the\nold width until something else moved it."
    text  "扫掠填充的宽度。在属性处进行钳制，并立即重新放置：\n宽度由扫掠读取，否则因零时长而停驻的扫掠会一直保持\n旧宽度，直到其他因素移动它。"
    state machine
}

