DreamProgressBar:Shape {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:Shape
    src   "Which silhouette the percent is spent on: a bar's width, or a ring's swept angle. A property,\nnot a subclass -- see the class comment, and EDreamProgressShape."
    text  "百分比作用在哪种轮廓上：条的宽度，还是环的扫掠角度。这是一个属性，\n而不是子类——请参见类注释和EDreamProgressShape。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBar:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#DreamProgressBar:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

EDreamProgressFillType {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamProgressBar.h#EDreamProgressFillType
    src   "Which edge a Bar's fill grows from -- UMG's EProgressBarFillType, its four DIRECTIONAL cases.\n\nFour rather than one because the slider next door has had Direction since it was written and a\nprogress bar that could only run left-to-right was the family's one asymmetry: a vertical charge\nmeter and a right-to-left bar (which is what a mirrored-for-RTL layout needs) were not expressible\nat all. UMG's two FillFromCenter cases are deliberately absent -- they are a different SHAPE of\nfill rather than a direction, and this control's Radial already covers the \"grows from a middle\"\nwant with something a bar cannot draw."
    text  "条的填充从哪条边生长——即UMG的EProgressBarFillType中它的四个方向性（DIRECTIONAL）用例。\n\n之所以是四个而不是一个，是因为隔壁的滑块从写出来起就有Direction，而一个\n只能从左到右的进度条是这个家族唯一的不对称之处：垂直电量表和从右到左的\n条（镜像RTL布局所需要的）根本无法表达。UMG的两个FillFromCenter用例被有意\n省略——它们是填充的不同形状而非方向，而此控件的Radial\n已经用条画不出来的方式满足了“从中间生长”\n的需求。"
    state machine
}

